  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of Rural Productive Livelihoods affected by Post Election Violence in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has been developed in response to the post-election violence in Kenya in early 2008.  Approximately 600,000 people were displaced and property and assets destroyed with a consequence of disrupted cultivation and trade which are constraints to the resumption of crop production and livelihoods security that this project seeks to address.</narrative>
  </description>
